### General
### Check API and database readiness
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Not found responses use Problem Details
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress}}/api/not-a-route
Accept: application/problem+json

### Authentication (Auth)
### Register a new user
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssword1"
}

### Login and receive a JWT token
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "alice",
  "password": "P@ssword1"
}

### Protected endpoints (use Authorization: Bearer {{token}})
### Get authenticated user info
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Accounts
### Create an account (requires auth)
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Checking"
}

### List accounts for the authenticated user
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get a specific account
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Balances
### Add a dated balance to an account (requires auth)
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-18",
  "amount": 123.45
}

### List balances for an account
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Pots and Goals
### Create a pot for an account
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/pots
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Holiday"
}

### List pots for an account
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/pots
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get a specific pot
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/pots/{{potId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a goal on a pot
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/pots/{{potId}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetAmount": 500.00,
  "dueDate": "2027-01-01"
}

### List goals for a pot
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/pots/{{potId}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Running (cumulative) balances for an account
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/running-balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Schedules (recurring income/expenses)
### Create a schedule on an account
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Salary",
  "amount": 2000.00,
  "startDate": "2026-10-01",
  "frequency": 2,
  "isIncome": true
}

### List schedules for an account
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Occurrences
### Create an occurrence (record actual income/expense)
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/occurrences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-01",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "isIncome": false,
  "scheduledItemId": null,
  "externalReference": "ext-123"
}

### List occurrences for an account
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/occurrences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Reconcile an occurrence (apply to balances once)
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/occurrences/{{occurrenceId}}/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Forecast
### Get forecast and Safe to Spend for an account
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/forecast
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Home summary
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/home
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Setup status
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/setup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Home summary and transfer recommendations
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/home
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
